<p>This is a very late contest entry. I wasn't really sure what I wanted to do for this contest or if I was going to be able to enter, but I've had this draft sitting around for a long time, and I do think it fits the theme. I apologise for basically throwing something premade out there - I had a lot of stuff going on around the time of the contest - but I guess the readers will judge.</p>
<p>This was initially intended to be a doomsday contest entry; thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2039383&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1579771882" alt="MrWrong" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2039383)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/mrwrong" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2039383); return false;">MrWrong</a></span> for reviewing the draft, way back when, and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ch00bakka" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1238719); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=1238719&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1579771882" alt="ch00bakka" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=1238719)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/ch00bakka" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(1238719); return false;">ch00bakka</a></span> and <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormfallen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2782824); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2782824&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1579771882" alt="stormfallen" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2782824)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/stormfallen" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2782824); return false;">stormfallen</a></span> for being on my team and being involved in brainstorming and discussions.</p>
<p>Also thanks to <span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wrongjohnsilver" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2000367); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=2000367&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1579771882" alt="WrongJohnSilver" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=2000367)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/wrongjohnsilver" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(2000367); return false;">WrongJohnSilver</a></span> for his blessing to use his team's worldbuilding.</p>
